### ============================================
### FORMACIÓN — REST Client
### ============================================
### Primero haz login para obtener el token.
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "user": "1193377218",
    "pass": "1193377218"
}

### ============================================
### FORMACIÓN
### ============================================

### 1. VER formaciones por usuario
GET http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/formaciones?id_usuario=3123

### 2. VER formaciones por usuario y tipo
GET http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/formaciones/porTipo?id_usuario=3123&tipo_formacion=informal

### 3. CREAR formación con certificado (multipart/form-data)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/formaciones
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_user"

3123
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tipo_formacion"

informal
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="programa"

AWS Cloud Begginer
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="institucion"

Amazon Web Services
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_grado"

2026-03-15
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_expedicion_certi"

2026-07-01
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="duracion"

5
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="certificado"; filename="certificado.pdf"; filename*="UTF-8''certificado.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:/Users/Soporte/Downloads/seguimiento_equipo_computo_2026-07-03-08-28-49.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### 4. CREAR formación sin certificado
POST http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/formaciones
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_user"

3123
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tipo_formacion"

pregrado
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="programa"

Ingeniería de Sistemas
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="institucion"

Universidad Nacional
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_grado"

2023-06-15
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_expedicion_certi"

2023-07-01
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="duracion"

5
--WebAppBoundary--

### 5. ACTUALIZAR formación con nuevo certificado
### NOTA: usar POST + _method=PUT para multipart/form-data en Laravel
POST http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/formaciones
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="_method"

PUT
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"

535
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_user"

3123
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tipo_formacion"

informal
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="programa"

AWS Cloud Practitioner
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="institucion"

Amazon Web Services
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_grado"

2026-03-15
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_expedicion_certi"

2026-07-01
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="duracion"

5
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="certificado"; filename="certificado_nuevo.pdf"; filename*="UTF-8''certificado_nuevo.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:/Users/Soporte/Downloads/seguimiento_equipo_computo_2026-07-03-08-28-49.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### 6. ELIMINAR formación por id (borra certificado de storage)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/formaciones
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "id": 1
}

### 7. ELIMINAR todas las formaciones de un usuario
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/formaciones/usuario
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "id_usuario": 1
}
